{"page":153,"width":1847,"height":2801,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4.6 스레드와 •관련된 문제를 207","words":[{"text":"4.6","x":1175,"y":168,"width":58,"height":24},{"text":"스레드와","x":1248,"y":168,"width":97,"height":26},{"text":"•관련된","x":1353,"y":167,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"문제를","x":1437,"y":168,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"207","x":1585,"y":163,"width":62,"height":31}]},{"text":"스를 강제 종료시기기나 타이머가 만료되는 경우가 포합된다. 비동기식 신호는 통상 다","words":[{"text":"스를","x":309,"y":306,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"강제","x":392,"y":306,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"종료시기기나","x":473,"y":307,"width":200,"height":41},{"text":"타이머가","x":689,"y":309,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"만료되는","x":837,"y":307,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"경우가","x":989,"y":305,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"포합된다.","x":1104,"y":304,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"비동기식","x":1266,"y":304,"width":130,"height":41},{"text":"신호는","x":1416,"y":305,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"통상","x":1531,"y":305,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"다","x":1615,"y":306,"width":35,"height":39}]},{"text":"프로세스에 전달된다.","words":[{"text":"프로세스에","x":355,"y":370,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"전달된다.","x":539,"y":372,"width":136,"height":39}]},{"text":"모든 신호는 둘 중 하나의 처리기에 의해 처리된다.","words":[{"text":"모든","x":373,"y":437,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"신호는","x":454,"y":436,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"둘","x":565,"y":438,"width":32,"height":36},{"text":"중","x":609,"y":438,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":656,"y":437,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"처리기에","x":769,"y":437,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":916,"y":436,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"처리된다.","x":997,"y":435,"width":142,"height":41}]},{"text":"1. 디폴트 신호 처리기","words":[{"text":"1.","x":341,"y":537,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"디폴트","x":384,"y":532,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":498,"y":534,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"처리기","x":577,"y":534,"width":94,"height":39}]},{"text":"2. 싸우자 정의 신호 처리기","words":[{"text":"2.","x":340,"y":602,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"싸우자","x":383,"y":598,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"정의","x":498,"y":598,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":577,"y":599,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"처리기","x":657,"y":599,"width":94,"height":39}]},{"text":"모든 신호마다 커널이 실행시기는 디폴트 신호 처리기가 있다. 이 디폴트 처리기는","words":[{"text":"모든","x":373,"y":730,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"신호마다","x":457,"y":729,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"커널이","x":609,"y":730,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"실행시기는","x":723,"y":729,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"디폴트","x":907,"y":730,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":1023,"y":731,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"처리기가","x":1106,"y":731,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1257,"y":730,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1349,"y":730,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"디폴트","x":1398,"y":730,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"처리기는","x":1514,"y":729,"width":137,"height":39}]},{"text":"신호를 처리하기 위하여 호출되는 사용자 정의 처리기에 의해 대체될 수 있다. 신호는","words":[{"text":"신호를","x":311,"y":793,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"처리하기","x":429,"y":794,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"위하여","x":581,"y":795,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"호출되는","x":697,"y":795,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"사용자","x":848,"y":795,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"정의","x":968,"y":795,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"처리기에","x":1052,"y":795,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"의해","x":1203,"y":795,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"대체될","x":1287,"y":794,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1403,"y":794,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1456,"y":794,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"신호는","x":1548,"y":794,"width":102,"height":37}]},{"text":"다른 방식으로 처리될 수 있다. 일부 신호는 무시될 수 있지만 다른 신호(예: 불법 메모","words":[{"text":"다른","x":309,"y":858,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"방식으로","x":392,"y":859,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"처리될","x":544,"y":859,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":658,"y":860,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":709,"y":860,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"일부","x":801,"y":860,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"신호는","x":882,"y":860,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"무시될","x":998,"y":860,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1113,"y":861,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있지만","x":1165,"y":860,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1278,"y":859,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"신호(예:","x":1361,"y":858,"width":121,"height":41},{"text":"불법","x":1499,"y":858,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"메모","x":1583,"y":857,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"리 액세스)는 프로그램을 종료하여 처리된다.","words":[{"text":"리","x":310,"y":923,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"액세스)는","x":355,"y":923,"width":149,"height":43},{"text":"프로그램을","x":515,"y":925,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"종료하여","x":697,"y":925,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"처리된다.","x":848,"y":924,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"단일 스레드 프로그램에서의 신호 처리는 간단하다. 신호는 항상 프로세스에 전달된","words":[{"text":"단일","x":371,"y":988,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"스레드","x":451,"y":989,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램에서의","x":566,"y":989,"width":236,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":819,"y":989,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"처리는","x":901,"y":990,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"간단하다.","x":1016,"y":990,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"신호는","x":1174,"y":990,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"항상","x":1286,"y":988,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스에","x":1367,"y":985,"width":167,"height":40},{"text":"전달된","x":1551,"y":984,"width":98,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 그러나 프로세스가 여러 스레드를 가지고 있는 다중 스레드 프로그램에서의 신호 처","words":[{"text":"다.","x":307,"y":1051,"width":40,"height":39},{"text":"그러나","x":363,"y":1052,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":478,"y":1054,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"여러","x":664,"y":1054,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"스레드를","x":744,"y":1055,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"가지고","x":894,"y":1054,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"있는","x":1014,"y":1054,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"다중","x":1094,"y":1054,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"스레드","x":1174,"y":1054,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램에서의","x":1288,"y":1050,"width":233,"height":39},{"text":"신호","x":1538,"y":1049,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"처","x":1619,"y":1048,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"리는 더욱 복잡하다. 어느 스레드에 신호를 전달해야 하는가?","words":[{"text":"리는","x":309,"y":1116,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"더욱","x":388,"y":1117,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"복잡하다.","x":466,"y":1118,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"어느","x":626,"y":1119,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"스레드에","x":705,"y":1119,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"신호를","x":856,"y":1119,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"전달해야","x":973,"y":1119,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"하는가?","x":1122,"y":1119,"width":116,"height":38}]},{"text":"일반적으로 다음과 같은 선택이 존재한다.","words":[{"text":"일반적으로","x":371,"y":1181,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"다음과","x":552,"y":1183,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":667,"y":1184,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"선택이","x":748,"y":1184,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"존재한다.","x":862,"y":1183,"width":147,"height":39}]},{"text":"1. 신호가 적용될 스레드에게 전달한다.","words":[{"text":"1.","x":336,"y":1283,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"신호가","x":379,"y":1278,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"적용될","x":492,"y":1279,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"스레드에게","x":605,"y":1280,"width":170,"height":39},{"text":"전달한다.","x":791,"y":1281,"width":145,"height":38}]},{"text":"2. 모든 스레드에 전달한다.","words":[{"text":"2.","x":336,"y":1347,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"모든","x":377,"y":1345,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"스레드에","x":456,"y":1344,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"전달한다.","x":606,"y":1344,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"3. 몇몇 스레드들에만 선택적으로 전달한다.","words":[{"text":"3.","x":336,"y":1411,"width":26,"height":29},{"text":"몇몇","x":379,"y":1407,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"스레드들에만","x":457,"y":1408,"width":204,"height":39},{"text":"선택적으로","x":673,"y":1408,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"전달한다.","x":859,"y":1409,"width":147,"height":39}]},{"text":"4. 특정 스레드가 모든 신호를 전달받도록 지정한다.","words":[{"text":"4.","x":335,"y":1476,"width":27,"height":28},{"text":"특정","x":376,"y":1472,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"스레드가","x":456,"y":1472,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":603,"y":1474,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"신호를","x":685,"y":1472,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"전달받도록","x":801,"y":1473,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"지정한다.","x":989,"y":1474,"width":145,"height":39}]},{"text":"신호를 전달하는 방법은 신호의 유형에 따라 다르다. 예를 들어 동기식 신호는 그 신","words":[{"text":"신호를","x":370,"y":1602,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"전달하는","x":483,"y":1602,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"방법은","x":629,"y":1602,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"신호의","x":744,"y":1602,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"유형에","x":859,"y":1602,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"따라","x":979,"y":1603,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"다르다.","x":1060,"y":1605,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1187,"y":1605,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"들어","x":1264,"y":1605,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"동기식","x":1343,"y":1603,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"신호는","x":1457,"y":1603,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1569,"y":1609,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"신","x":1616,"y":1603,"width":32,"height":37}]},{"text":"호를 아기한 스레드에 전달되어야 하고 다른 스레드에 전달되면 안 된다. 그러나 비동기","words":[{"text":"호를","x":307,"y":1668,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"아기한","x":387,"y":1667,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"스레드에","x":500,"y":1667,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"전달되어야","x":649,"y":1667,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"하고","x":833,"y":1667,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":916,"y":1668,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"스레드에","x":998,"y":1668,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"전달되면","x":1152,"y":1668,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"안","x":1299,"y":1668,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"된다.","x":1345,"y":1668,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1433,"y":1666,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"비동기","x":1548,"y":1667,"width":97,"height":39}]},{"text":"식 신호의 경유는 명확하지 않다. \u003ccontr01\u003e\u003cC\u003e 같은 카를 쳐서 그 프로세스를 강제","words":[{"text":"식","x":308,"y":1732,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"신호의","x":357,"y":1732,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"경유는","x":474,"y":1732,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"명확하지","x":590,"y":1732,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"않다.","x":742,"y":1732,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"\u003ccontr01\u003e\u003cC\u003e","x":837,"y":1738,"width":243,"height":27},{"text":"같은","x":1098,"y":1732,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"카를","x":1184,"y":1733,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"쳐서","x":1265,"y":1732,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1347,"y":1738,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1396,"y":1731,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"강제","x":1582,"y":1732,"width":64,"height":38}]},{"text":"종료하는 신호와 같은 어떤 비동기식 신호는 그 프로세스 내 모든 스레드에 전달되어야","words":[{"text":"종료하는","x":307,"y":1796,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"신호와","x":456,"y":1796,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":571,"y":1797,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"어떤","x":653,"y":1796,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"비동기식","x":736,"y":1797,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"신호는","x":886,"y":1797,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1003,"y":1802,"width":35,"height":26},{"text":"프로세스","x":1051,"y":1797,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"내","x":1203,"y":1797,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1249,"y":1798,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"스레드에","x":1331,"y":1795,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"전달되어야","x":1481,"y":1795,"width":170,"height":40}]},{"text":"한다. 신호를 전달하는 데 사용되는 표준 UNIX 함수는","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":309,"y":1861,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"신호를","x":398,"y":1862,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"전달하는","x":511,"y":1861,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"데","x":657,"y":1861,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"사용되는","x":702,"y":1861,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"표준","x":852,"y":1864,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"UNIX","x":931,"y":1865,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"함수는","x":1048,"y":1861,"width":104,"height":38}]},{"text":"kill(pid-t pid, int signal)","words":[{"text":"kill(pid-t","x":371,"y":1945,"width":203